OL,3,GNEWSAHopes for needle-free allergy
OL,4,Aspray to be approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarc Jenkins, senior pharmacist in the
OL,7,FPrescribing Support Unit, said
OL,8,Fmedication underwent a "thorough
OL,9,Fclinical and financial assessment"
OL,10,Fbefore a decision was made by the
OL,11,FTherapeutics Advisory Group for local
OL,12,Fuse.
